   "kind": "finding",
   "id": "F6",
   "agent": "baseline",
   "task": null,
   "verified": true,
   "statement": "The restarts counter is 0 through 2026-03-21T18:00 and increments to 1 (~03-21T21-24), 2 (~03-22T21-24) and 3 (~03-23T18-21), matching the three OOM events."
  },
  {
   "t": 74.674,
   "kind": "finding",
   "id": "F7",
   "agent": "baseline",
   "task": null,
   "verified": true,
   "statement": "The only Kafka change was at 2026-03-23T18:00:00Z (cfg-2410), reducing log.retention.ms from 604800000 to 259200000 (7d -> 3d) \u2014 a retention REDUCTION, described as 'reduce retention to 3 days'."
