   "agent": "baseline",
   "task": null,
   "verified": true,
   "statement": "At the Kafka change time (2026-03-23T18:00) notification-service memory was already 94.63% avg (95.05% in the 2h view) \u2014 well into the third leak cycle that began ~2026-03-22T22."
  },
  {
   "t": 74.676,
   "kind": "finding",
   "id": "F9",
   "agent": "baseline",
   "task": null,
   "verified": true,
   "statement": "Two earlier OOMKills (2026-03-21T22:59:50 and 2026-03-22T21:59:47) occurred with no Kafka maintenance in the window; the Kafka retention change on 03-23T18:00 was the only Kafka config change across 03-20 to 03-23."
  },
  {
